sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor G as Guard
  participant B as Browser (scanner.js)
  participant IDB as IndexedDB
  participant SW as Service Worker
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as Database
  G->>B: scans QR
  B->>API: POST /api/qr/verify
  Note over B,API: network is down - fetch() throws
  B->>IDB: save op_id, type, token, time, status PENDING
  B-->>G: Saved - NOT verified yet
  Note over SW: pages and scripts still load from cache
  B->>API: GET /api/network/ping every 5 s
  API-->>B: pong - connection is back
  B->>IDB: PENDING to SYNCING
  B->>API: POST /api/sync (batch of operations)
  API->>DB: INSERT sync_operation (UNIQUE operation_id)
  alt operation_id already known
    API-->>B: stored result, replayed = true
  else new operation
    API->>DB: verify token hash, consume pass, write visit_log
    API-->>B: success or failed with reason
  end
  B->>IDB: SYNCING to SUCCESS or FAILED, token erased
  B-->>G: Verified / Rejected
